From 28959091e4b10b9e3542d6e3d517a7ee1a7c64b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:11:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: mediatek: compose bounded WMT mode negotiation

Keep separate persistent default, set and full query records under the
shared CONSYS owner. Retain clocks/power and stop at the first failed
phase. Select the extra exchanges only through a distinct deferred
diagnostic property.

Internal experiment archive; synthetic non-certifying author, no DCO.
Compile-review only; no hardware result.

Port onto the Wi-Fi scan line for the combined Phase A profile; logic
unchanged, context adjusted beside the scan-line CONSYS changes.
---
